(D1 -- minimal repro. LANGUAGE.md:4926-4929: "It will not overwrite a
 .lib that already exists -- a repeat --shared build errors and asks you
 to remove the .lib first". It does not error; it silently rewrites the
 .lib, clobbering any hand edit. Needs --shared, so not auto-run; see
 shared/LIB-overwrite.vox for the fuller version and the ledger's
 Discrepancies section for the reading.
